{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story-driven adult visual novel packed with drama, humor, impactful choices\u2014and a bit of chaos. In RAVE, you step into the shoes of a troublemaker who's finally pushed things too far. Now it\u2019s time to rebuild your life... or make an even bigger mess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839980/extras/295f35c6deb5a609f2cf0c31ee1a883e.avif?t=1753261301\" width=800 height=284 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve just hit rock bottom. But this time, there are no more second chances. In RAVE, you\u2019ll navigate the tangled lives of a vivid cast of characters as you try to piece yourself back together\u2014one reckless decision at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839980/extras/517c0a3751b273a372c7e24cf349c4de.avif?t=1753261301\" width=800 height=284 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is Episode 1, kicking off a larger narrative already written through Episode 8. It\u2019s a slower, more character-focused beginning\u2014designed to let you feel every beat, every misstep, and every spark of chemistry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839980/extras/f09602cfffb61ce189b30bab963d309c.avif?t=1753261301\" width=800 height=284 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite the introduction of casual side girls and way more lewd content in upcoming episodes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rave uses sex scenes as a natural extension of character relationships\u2014emotional climaxes, turning points, or entanglements. The focus remains on storytelling, growth, and meaningful choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh\u2014and yes, there\u2019s sex. But it\u2019s the story that keeps things hot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839980/extras/04a4676c6b19be174601a62bd416bd57.avif?t=1753261301\" width=800 height=284 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1+ hour of story-driven gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 branches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 spicy scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choice feedback (optional)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A consistent UI experience for choices, messages, and upcoming free-roam events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No narration or MC inner monologue \u2014 it's all you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully implemented music (sfx included)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices that matter \u2014 even small ones ripple through the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo dev commitment \u2014 consistent updates, with a finished script up to Episode 8</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cBe there for them\u2026 and watch them move mountains for you.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839980/extras/d6738dbb3aeb06da169f9562a076c5ad.avif?t=1753261301\" width=800 height=284 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamsta